  "publishedAt": "2023-02-15T00:00:00Z",
  "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/mantis-case-study",
  "sourceTitle": "Why we’re switching to Hugging Face Inference Endpoints, and maybe you should too",
  "sourceBodyHash": "3aa06a4ea56dd1cf6a8511578b7ab5153675d474bb125a2bb8b38034c0b99fbd",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 4,
  "provider": "zcode",
  "requestedModel": "",
  "model": "glm-5.3-flash",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-17T05:46:30.752706Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-17T05:46:30.752706Z",
  "totalBlocks": 48,
  "translatedBlocks": 48,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b12fbc157fb367b5",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face 最近推出了 Inference Endpoints；用他们的话说：解决 Transformers 的生产部署问题。Inference Endpoints 是一项托管服务，让你可以：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e493c11b97170a9b",
      "translationZh": "部署（几乎）任何 Hugging Face Hub 上的模型",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f5fb15373efc9115",
      "translationZh": "到任何云（AWS、Azure，GCP 即将到来）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b092c4b4421ebcad",
      "translationZh": "使用多种实例类型（包括 GPU）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5dd5f0f5ce68a282",
      "translationZh": "我们正在把一些做 CPU 推理的机器学习（ML）模型迁移到这项新服务。这篇博客讲为什么，以及你可能也想考虑它的原因。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7f7e24ae20384ef8",
      "translationZh": "我们原来是怎么做的？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9fe1854cf6480e60",
      "translationZh": "我们迁移到 Inference Endpoints 的模型，此前由内部管理，跑在 AWS Fargate 支持的 AWS Elastic Container Service（ECS）上。它给你一个可运行容器任务的无服务器集群。我们的流程是：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "68b77bd72794b15a",
      "translationZh": "在 GPU 实例上训练模型（CML 供给，transformers 训练）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8b57258b60ae9e74",
      "translationZh": "上传到 Hugging Face Hub",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dc66ca2aa700c860",
      "translationZh": "构建服务模型的 API（FastAPI）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "93fdaecdc8f3e121",
      "translationZh": "把 API 打包成容器（Docker）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8de8e989bf90f326",
      "translationZh": "把容器上传到 AWS Elastic Container Repository（ECR）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6c048c2b0b140eef",
      "translationZh": "把模型部署到 ECS 集群",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16a6a1a5cb21ab66",
      "translationZh": "你完全有理由说 ECS 不是服务 ML 模型的最佳方式，但它支撑我们走到了今天，还让 ML 模型能与其他容器化服务并列部署，降低了认知负担。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d246ea58bbd5e52f",
      "translationZh": "现在我们怎么做？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef26e080c6f33322",
      "translationZh": "用上 Inference Endpoints 后，我们的流程变成：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "68b77bd72794b15a",
      "translationZh": "在 GPU 实例上训练模型（CML 供给，transformers 训练）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8b57258b60ae9e74",
      "translationZh": "上传到 Hugging Face Hub",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "776f2aef7ea56ff0",
      "translationZh": "用 Hugging Face Inference Endpoints 部署。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0a85a9bcb85db79",
      "translationZh": "这明显简单多了。我们也可以用别的托管服务，如 SageMaker、Seldon 或 Bento ML 等，但由于我们已经把模型上传 Hugging Face hub 充当模型注册表，而且深度使用 Hugging Face 的其他工具（如 transformers 和 AutoTrain），用 Inference Endpoints 对我们来说非常合理。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0fd9da8242fc88ca",
      "translationZh": "延迟和稳定性如何？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80a7a3e55c72a437",
      "translationZh": "切换到 Inference Endpoints 之前，我们用 ab 测试了不同的 CPU 端点类型。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3084b3b92f1b4862",
      "translationZh": "ECS 我们没有测得那么细，但已知大容器从同区域实例访问的延迟约 200ms。Inference Endpoints 的测试基于一个在 RoBERTa 上微调的文本分类模型，测试参数如下：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5c2824a115c6dd5b",
      "translationZh": "请求方区域：eu-east-1",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "610ae493e81b3728",
      "translationZh": "请求方实例规格：t3-medium",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "22d3c800d9ca2cbe",
      "translationZh": "推理端点区域：eu-east-1",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3c7dc3f65b29ce4d",
      "translationZh": "端点副本数：1",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d32a1df1984c4afc",
      "translationZh": "并发连接数：1",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ea45298b304c6b19",
      "translationZh": "请求数：1000（即便单连接在 1-2 分钟内发 1000 个请求，对这个特定应用也算非常重的使用）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "172573499b9079b2",
      "translationZh": "下表展示了四个配备 Intel Ice Lake 的 CPU 端点的延迟（毫秒 ± 标准差）和测试完成时间（秒）。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "53ced431a267f1c5",
      "translationZh": "这些结果令人鼓舞。消费这些端点的应用要实时响应请求，所以我们需要尽可能低的延迟。可以看到，原生 Hugging Face 容器比我们在 ECS 上跑的自制容器快了一倍多——大规格 Inference Endpoint 的最慢响应也只有 108ms。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "77106870cc5e5a6d",
      "translationZh": "成本呢？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3071879b05dae8b",
      "translationZh": "那这一切要花多少钱？下表比较了我们此前的做法（ECS + Fargate）与使用 Inference Endpoints 的价格。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3680d53cad7701d",
      "translationZh": "关于这个表可以说两点。首先，我们想要托管的部署方案——我们（还）没有专门的 MLOps 团队——所以在寻找能最小化部署模型时间的方案，哪怕比自己动手贵一点。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6175dfc0ffbe7507",
      "translationZh": "Inference Endpoints 比我们之前的做法贵，成本增加 24% 到 50%。以我们目前的规模，这笔额外的费用——大规格 CPU 实例每月约 60 美元的差价——与省下的操心 API 和容器的时间与认知负担相比微不足道。如果我们要部署成百上千个 ML 微服务，可能要重新考虑；但对许多托管方式而言都是如此。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9db1f9f7f0b71a87",
      "translationZh": "一些说明与注意事项：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3420cc5c71d3f493",
      "translationZh": "Inference Endpoints 的定价见这里，但从 GUI 部署新端点时显示的是另一个数字。我用的是后者，更高的那个。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f1e2e953a7bf305f",
      "translationZh": "我在表中给出的 ECS + Fargate 数值是低估，但应该差得不多。它们取自 Fargate 定价页，只包含托管实例的费用；没有包含数据入/出站费用（最大的可能是从 Hugging Face hub 下载模型），也没包含与 ECR 相关的费用。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b160572474df9c80",
      "translationZh": "其他考虑",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7b9fcf01d114f173",
      "translationZh": "部署选项",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e22b93481024bab",
      "translationZh": "目前可以通过 GUI 或 RESTful API 部署 Inference Endpoint。你也可以用我们的命令行工具 hugie（未来博文的主题），传入一份配置一行代码就能启动 Inference Endpoint，就是这么简单：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3f89c7986ae06ae",
      "translationZh": "对我来说，缺少的是一个自定义 terraform provider。用 hugie 从 GitHub action 部署推理端点固然好，但如果能用 terraform 这个出色的状态机来跟踪它们就更好了。我很确定很快会有人（如果不是 Hugging Face）写一个——如果没有，我们会写。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "53d1106a856d03f5",
      "translationZh": "在单个端点上托管多个模型",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0be01a78e74fe2b9",
      "translationZh": "Philipp Schmid 写了一篇很棒的博客，讲如何编写自定义 Endpoint Handler 类，从而在单个端点上托管多个模型，可能帮你省下不少钱。他的博客讲的是 GPU 推理，唯一的实际限制是 GPU 显存能装下多少模型。我猜这对 CPU 实例同样适用，不过我还没试过。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "00247085396c26d7",
      "translationZh": "最后……",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05ff0cfe3672d698",
      "translationZh": "我们发现 Hugging Face Inference Endpoints 是把 transformer（以及 sklearn）模型部署成端点、供应用消费的非常简单便捷的方式。虽然它比我们之前用 ECS 的方式贵一点，但完全值得——它省去了我们思考部署的时间，让我们能专注于真正想做的事：为客户构建 NLP 解决方案，帮他们解决问题。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f72526d433f8e070",
      "translationZh": "如果你的公司对 Hugging Face Inference Endpoints 感兴趣，请在这里联系我们——我们的团队会联系你讨论需求！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2343b654b70b9005",
      "translationZh": "本文最初于 2023 年 2 月 15 日发布于 Medium。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    }
  ],
